Context()->variables->are(n => 'Real'); $f = random(3, 6, 1); $fword = numberWord($f); $expression = Formula("n + $f");
###### # Body ######
BEGIN_PGML Suppose [`n`] family members live in a home, and some cousins, a family of [$fword], comes to stay for a week. Give an expression for how many people live in that house during that week.
[_]{$expression}{20}
END_PGML
